--- !u!114 &1411887974
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 9
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Is that so? That really helps a lot. Thank you, I\u2019ll be on my
    way then."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1693439173}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f561f52b73c81424c8a1d0b389e5cac4, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887975
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 8
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: I think he should have a way to find some magical cats.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1750330213}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a413615114f624c80830af18bd4707d9, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887976
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 7
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'I once saved him before, and he should still be living in the forest
    now. You can go find him and say that I sent you. '
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1750330213}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a413615114f624c80830af18bd4707d9, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887977
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 6
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'Ah, as it happens, I know a child in the nearby Forest who is very
    skilled in the language of cats. '
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1750330213}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a413615114f624c80830af18bd4707d9, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887978
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 5
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: I see... Then where am I supposed to find a cat willing to travel around
    with me...?
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1693439173}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f561f52b73c81424c8a1d0b389e5cac4, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887979
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 4
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: The king said you know something about its weakness.
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1693439173}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f561f52b73c81424c8a1d0b389e5cac4, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887980
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 3
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "That\u2019s right, I have heard. I once looked through records left
    behind by people who tried to slay the dragon, "
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1750330213}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a413615114f624c80830af18bd4707d9, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887981
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 2
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'and I found that the dragon seems to be wary of a certain creature:
    cats.'
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1750330213}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a413615114f624c80830af18bd4707d9, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1411887982
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1411887972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 1
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Long time no see, Merlin. I think you must have already heard that
    I\u2019m going to rescue the princess. "
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1693439173}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f561f52b73c81424c8a1d0b389e5cac4, type: 3}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
